        "original_paragraph": "The binding a\ufb03nity of compounds and 3CLpro was analyzed using a Biacore S200 system (GE Healthcare). Briefly, 100 \u03bcg of 3CLpro was immobilized on a CM5 sensor chip using a pH = 4.0 acetic acid solution. Compounds 3 and 4 and baicalein at di\ufb00erent concentrations (50, 40, 30, 15, 7.5, 3.75, and 1.875 \u03bcM) were injected for 120 s at a flow rate of 40 \u03bcL/min. A cleaning solution of PBS with 50% DMSO was used to regenerate the CM5 chip. All response values were collected at 25\u00b0C. Biacore Evaluation Software 2.0 was used to generate Kd values.",
